WEBVTT

00:02.080 --> 00:05.700
Ayako-san. Ayako-san! Ayako-san!

00:05.700 --> 00:06.460
I can feel it.

00:06.460 --> 00:08.620
The Return to the Beginning has begun.

00:08.620 --> 00:10.420
But that’s not all.

00:10.420 --> 00:11.450
This beatrice...

00:12.150 --> 00:14.370
I can feel Ayako-san.

00:14.370 --> 00:16.090
What’s going on?

00:16.090 --> 00:19.200
Ayako-san, I’m coming for you!

00:36.140 --> 00:41.260
Today I shout out another good morning courageously

00:41.260 --> 00:46.560
The sparkling chime of hope is resounding

00:47.050 --> 00:52.140
The gentle sun is always

00:52.140 --> 00:57.660
Blessing the late coming sensation of the two of them

00:57.950 --> 01:02.880
To fall in love with a goddess is the best!

01:03.090 --> 01:12.950
Even if she is a beatrice I can't control this throbbing feeling

01:12.950 --> 01:13.800
L·O·V·E

01:13.800 --> 01:15.550
I love you MA·MO·RU!

01:15.550 --> 01:17.090
These overflowing feelings

01:17.090 --> 01:19.790
Take them high into the sky

01:19.790 --> 01:24.680
Please grant me my dazzling and sparkling dream

01:24.680 --> 01:26.480
That's right MA·MO·RU!

01:26.480 --> 01:28.010
Only for you

01:28.010 --> 01:30.680
I will show you my power of miracles

01:30.680 --> 01:32.950
I will surely, surely swear

01:32.950 --> 01:38.900
I will not end my Shining Love

01:54.160 --> 01:55.170
Finally.

01:55.760 --> 01:58.420
Now, cry out, beatrice!

01:58.420 --> 02:00.260
Let me hear your voice.

02:00.260 --> 02:02.300
What do you seek?

02:02.300 --> 02:04.000
What will you tell us?!

02:09.740 --> 02:10.940
What is this...

02:46.360 --> 02:47.140
Ayako!

03:10.650 --> 03:12.070
Witch Beatrice...

03:16.770 --> 03:20.960
The Return to the Beginning absorbed her?

03:35.960 --> 03:40.190
The Invincible Two

03:42.300 --> 03:43.100
Well?

03:43.100 --> 03:45.250
Can you feel the Witch Beatrice?

03:47.190 --> 03:51.140
The Ayako-san I know is getting smaller.

03:51.140 --> 03:52.290
But...

03:52.290 --> 03:54.890
But it isn’t disappearing.

03:54.890 --> 04:01.970
Ayako-san... No, an Ayako-san
I don’t know is getting bigger.

04:02.600 --> 04:04.260
Masaki...

04:04.900 --> 04:08.590
That’s why I don’t like little kids.

04:08.590 --> 04:10.990
I need to give him a spanking.

04:11.480 --> 04:13.100
We’re flooring it, Mamoru-kun!

04:13.100 --> 04:14.710
R-Right.

04:16.460 --> 04:18.200
What happened?

04:18.200 --> 04:19.070
I don’t know.

04:19.440 --> 04:20.600
But I think...

04:25.130 --> 04:26.980
Sudou Maya...

04:26.980 --> 04:28.480
Emelenzia...

04:56.680 --> 04:57.900
Wait, Johan.

04:57.900 --> 04:58.990
What?

04:59.490 --> 05:01.420
I have a bad feeling about this.

05:01.420 --> 05:03.200
We shouldn’t just attack it. We should...

05:03.200 --> 05:05.490
In the end, you can do nothing.

05:05.490 --> 05:07.780
Just stand there and watch.

05:25.260 --> 05:26.530
Is it working?

05:27.130 --> 05:30.360
I don’t know if it will last that long...

05:58.510 --> 05:59.750
Oh, no!

06:06.700 --> 06:09.580
The attacks didn’t work at all?

06:13.150 --> 06:15.810
If that thing gets to town...

06:15.810 --> 06:17.280
Once more.

06:17.280 --> 06:18.710
We’ll hit it with the beatrice cannons once more.

06:18.710 --> 06:19.980
Don’t try to attack it!

06:19.980 --> 06:23.300
The Return to the Beginning is the beatrice itself.

06:23.300 --> 06:27.410
Beatrice attacks just feed it.

06:27.410 --> 06:28.650
So...

06:31.990 --> 06:34.450
Takasu Masaki, identity confirmed.

06:34.450 --> 06:35.950
Activating Beatrice Barrier.

06:43.450 --> 06:45.180
Leave this to me.

06:45.810 --> 06:49.820
Get out of here before the barrier forms,

06:49.820 --> 06:54.960
and bring me the Silver Maria and Yoshimura Mamoru!

07:01.580 --> 07:02.530
Brother?

07:04.800 --> 07:08.390
Brother, we need to hurry,
or we won’t be able to get out!

07:09.990 --> 07:11.040
He’s...

07:19.390 --> 07:20.640
Yes.

07:20.640 --> 07:21.910
That’s right.

07:22.460 --> 07:26.000
We can’t let the Return to the Beginning escape.

07:26.000 --> 07:30.240
Even if this place becomes my grave.

07:34.730 --> 07:35.970
Masaki...

07:42.730 --> 07:44.390
Made it in time?

08:00.830 --> 08:02.750
You made a beatrice illusion?

08:04.850 --> 08:06.160
Takasu Masaki.

08:07.600 --> 08:12.830
Do you plan to die here alone,
with the Return to the Beginning?

08:18.580 --> 08:20.240
Let’s go, Emelenzia.

08:20.240 --> 08:22.560
But... But my brother...

08:22.560 --> 08:24.220
Don’t forget!

08:26.410 --> 08:31.190
Even without any power, there’s something we can do.

08:31.190 --> 08:33.450
Sudou Maya.

08:33.450 --> 08:35.950
Let’s go get Mamoru-kun.

08:37.510 --> 08:38.540
Yes!

08:39.560 --> 08:44.590
This is my sin, Johan.

08:44.590 --> 08:47.370
There’s no need for you to die with me.

08:48.500 --> 08:52.690
The beatrice has always been an ally to mankind.

08:53.620 --> 08:56.810
I failed to realize its intentions. I...

08:56.810 --> 08:59.680
Enough of your arrogance.

09:00.300 --> 09:05.690
Do you think this research could have
proceeded without me?

09:06.300 --> 09:07.120
I...

09:07.120 --> 09:08.860
I won’t let you do this alone.

09:11.050 --> 09:14.060
The Return to the Beginning that we desired for so long...

09:14.690 --> 09:17.170
The Witch Beatrice is inside it.

09:18.220 --> 09:20.510
If you’re going to die with it...

09:21.340 --> 09:23.080
I’ll die here, too.

09:27.960 --> 09:29.580
A horrible cry.

09:30.020 --> 09:35.520
That cry is the Witch Beatrice, seeking Mamoru.

09:35.520 --> 09:37.790
Seeking Mamoru-kun?

09:37.790 --> 09:39.280
Yes.

09:39.280 --> 09:41.390
I can tell.

09:41.390 --> 09:45.670
My heart is always calling him, too.

09:46.440 --> 09:50.210
Always, always calling him.

09:50.210 --> 09:51.660
Student Council President!

09:51.660 --> 09:52.830
Emelenzia!

09:59.890 --> 10:01.670
I’m sorry, Mamoru-kun!

10:02.380 --> 10:08.200
While you were gone,
the Return to the Beginning absorbed Ayako!

10:11.350 --> 10:13.520
Is that true, President?

10:13.520 --> 10:15.220
Maria?

10:15.220 --> 10:18.860
And the knight on his white horse is here, too?

10:27.000 --> 10:29.450
That’s... Ayako-san?

10:30.230 --> 10:32.350
The poor beatrice...

10:33.100 --> 10:35.910
It’s been made into something so ugly.

10:37.780 --> 10:41.210
Masaki, can you hear me?

10:41.210 --> 10:42.770
Release this barrier.

10:42.770 --> 10:44.080
Are you insane?

10:44.080 --> 10:48.030
If I do that, the Return to the Beginning
will go out of control!

10:48.030 --> 10:52.200
Do you not care what happens to this city...
No, the entire world?

10:52.200 --> 10:54.500
It’s too late to pretend you care!

10:56.100 --> 10:58.050
I’ll take responsibility.

10:58.050 --> 10:58.940
Responsibility?

10:58.940 --> 11:00.580
Don’t be stupid.

11:00.580 --> 11:03.230
No one cares about your worthless life!

11:03.700 --> 11:06.010
If we lose the Witch Beatrice,

11:06.010 --> 11:08.180
what’s going to happen to these kids?

11:08.950 --> 11:11.980
Don’t even think about dying first and getting off easy!

11:11.980 --> 11:13.490
That is...

11:14.250 --> 11:18.360
Don’t listen to the old crone, Masaki.

11:26.430 --> 11:28.970
Really... Pathetic.

11:29.770 --> 11:31.680
Listen, Mamoru-kun.

11:31.680 --> 11:34.280
I’m going to destroy this barrier.

11:34.280 --> 11:37.230
But that’s all I can do.

11:38.160 --> 11:39.990
I won’t have any power left.

11:41.660 --> 11:42.780
Take this.

11:48.460 --> 11:51.340
Wh-What? My power...

11:51.340 --> 11:53.030
It’s being drained, right?

11:53.030 --> 11:57.320
It’s a small, but incredibly pure, Horacle.

11:57.320 --> 12:00.590
This is a Horacle...

12:01.390 --> 12:07.740
Feed this to the Return to the Beginning.

12:07.740 --> 12:09.170
Let it eat this?

12:09.170 --> 12:10.040
Yes.

12:10.600 --> 12:13.300
There’s not much possibility of success, though.

12:13.850 --> 12:17.830
As long as you have this, you can’t use beatrice.

12:18.560 --> 12:20.210
Your life will be in danger.

12:20.210 --> 12:21.470
It’s OK.

12:21.470 --> 12:22.650
I’ll do it.

12:22.650 --> 12:23.980
Mamoru!

12:25.190 --> 12:28.740
H-How can you just agree so easily?

12:28.740 --> 12:32.330
This is the only way to save Ayako-san, right?

12:33.240 --> 12:34.660
Yes, but...

12:34.660 --> 12:36.690
Then I’ll do it.

12:39.310 --> 12:40.910
You’re a mysterious person.

12:41.570 --> 12:44.870
Just like he used to be.

12:45.540 --> 12:50.010
Your beatrice ability is still undeveloped, but...

12:50.720 --> 12:52.870
it’s wonderful.

12:53.800 --> 12:56.290
I can see why the Witch Beatrice is crazy about you.

12:57.330 --> 12:59.160
You understand, right?

12:59.160 --> 13:03.010
Right now, you’re the only one who can do this.

13:08.090 --> 13:10.110
Are you really going?

13:10.110 --> 13:11.710
Of course!

13:11.710 --> 13:13.510
OK, Mamoru-kun.

13:13.510 --> 13:14.690
The rest is in your hands.

13:14.690 --> 13:15.950
Right.

13:37.880 --> 13:41.200
Stuff gets harder when you’re old.

13:41.200 --> 13:43.400
Are you OK, Maria-san?

13:50.070 --> 13:51.810
Stop it, Maria!

14:19.690 --> 14:20.900
Mamoru...

14:52.330 --> 14:53.870
Ayako-san?

14:54.810 --> 14:56.460
They’re gone...

14:56.460 --> 15:00.470
My mom and dad are gone...

15:01.130 --> 15:04.290
And they left me.

15:04.290 --> 15:05.100
Ayako-san...

15:05.100 --> 15:05.920
Stay back!

15:07.390 --> 15:08.840
I want to be alone!

15:10.420 --> 15:12.890
I want to be alone...

15:16.100 --> 15:17.430
Ayako-san!

15:34.990 --> 15:37.040
The bird’s stopped moving?

15:37.470 --> 15:38.810
What do you think that means?

15:39.420 --> 15:41.820
Something’s happening inside it...

15:41.820 --> 15:44.040
Damn you, Maria.
You’ve pushed yourself too hard.

15:44.040 --> 15:46.590
But it’s stopped moving.

15:46.590 --> 15:49.450
It’s just a temporary respite.

15:49.450 --> 15:54.290
We just have to hope it doesn’t leave
before the barrier reboots.

15:54.290 --> 15:56.300
How long will that take?

15:56.300 --> 15:57.300
Another two minutes.

15:59.940 --> 16:04.600
Four nations on the Beatrice Research Council
have initiated an inquiry.

16:04.600 --> 16:07.410
Beatrice factors all around the world are rising.

16:08.310 --> 16:12.200
If a decrease is not observed within five minutes, in accordance with treaty,

16:12.200 --> 16:14.560
special article five will be implemented.

16:14.560 --> 16:15.490
No!

16:15.490 --> 16:17.750
The destruction of the barrier alerted

16:17.750 --> 16:21.320
the rest of the world to the
Return to the Beginning’s presence?

16:21.320 --> 16:23.030
No!

16:23.030 --> 16:25.100
This can’t be happening...

16:25.100 --> 16:26.090
This...

16:26.090 --> 16:27.170
Mamoru!

16:30.570 --> 16:32.730
Mamoru’s beatrice...

16:32.730 --> 16:34.070
I can feel it.

16:35.140 --> 16:40.390
Mamoru-kun... Time to show what you’re made of.

16:42.540 --> 16:45.450
Don’t come any closer!

16:45.450 --> 16:48.710
Come any closer, and I’ll make you disappear!

16:50.690 --> 16:56.790
If they’re going to leave me behind,
I’d rather just get rid of them...

16:57.520 --> 16:59.190
Stay back...

16:59.720 --> 17:01.400
Stay back I said!

17:26.960 --> 17:28.940
Does it hurt?

17:33.670 --> 17:34.740
I’m sorry!

17:35.080 --> 17:36.280
I’m sorry...

17:37.380 --> 17:39.070
I’m sorry!

17:39.070 --> 17:43.550
You’re the one who’s hurting... Who’s suffering...

17:44.510 --> 17:46.240
But I’m the one crying...

17:47.320 --> 17:50.190
For such a little girl to say she wants to be alone...

17:50.190 --> 17:52.290
Such a little girl...

17:54.140 --> 17:58.510
You always were there to help me.

17:58.510 --> 18:01.850
You always made me happy.

18:01.860 --> 18:09.380
You were suffering so much... All the time...

18:13.990 --> 18:16.360
Ayako-san?

18:16.840 --> 18:17.810
Good boy.

18:18.740 --> 18:20.320
Good boy...

18:21.100 --> 18:25.700
No, Ayako-san, you’re the one who’s a good girl.

18:26.350 --> 18:27.980
A very girl.

18:28.620 --> 18:29.790
Good boy.

18:30.980 --> 18:33.490
Good girl... Good girl.

18:46.740 --> 18:49.970
Special article five has been approved.

18:50.430 --> 18:51.860
Point 0 confirmed.

18:51.860 --> 18:53.850
Leave the area immediately.

18:53.850 --> 18:57.030
Repeat, leave the area immediately.

19:24.710 --> 19:26.600
<i>It’s no good...</i>

19:27.940 --> 19:31.600
<i>I’m going to die here...</i>

19:32.240 --> 19:35.600
<i>Without being able to save Ayako-san...</i>

19:33.160 --> 19:37.110
No... No...

19:37.700 --> 19:39.220
Mamoru!

19:41.270 --> 19:42.490
<i>That’s right.</i>

19:46.620 --> 19:48.930
No... Mamoru!

19:49.580 --> 19:53.530
No! No! No!

19:53.530 --> 19:55.530
<i>I can’t forget...</i>

19:55.530 --> 19:58.220
<i>It isn’t me who’s hurt.</i>

19:58.890 --> 20:01.780
<i>She’s the one who’s suffering!</i>

20:05.920 --> 20:08.750
No... No...

20:16.260 --> 20:20.320
Ayako-san, I’ll protect you!

20:34.010 --> 20:35.640
Can you hear me, Maria?!

20:36.130 --> 20:37.340
This is an emergency!

20:38.900 --> 20:40.170
What’s wrong, Masaki?

20:40.530 --> 20:41.490
Listen.

20:41.490 --> 20:42.770
Listen carefully.

20:43.650 --> 20:48.050
The entire world is taking action to destroy
the Return to the Beginning.

20:49.960 --> 20:54.710
Beatrice Charter special article five
has just been activated.

20:55.440 --> 20:57.970
After a Beatrice factor rises to a certain level,

20:57.970 --> 21:00.180
if the Franklin Coefficient is maintained

21:00.180 --> 21:02.110
and the factor fails to recede after a given time,

21:02.880 --> 21:06.160
the beatrice is deemed out of control.

21:06.160 --> 21:08.490
And every planetary nation and organization

21:08.490 --> 21:11.110
is to deal with it by any means necessary.

21:11.560 --> 21:14.040
Get on this helicopter, and get out of here!

21:14.040 --> 21:15.850
There’s no time to talk!

21:15.850 --> 21:17.020
No way!

21:17.020 --> 21:17.830
They can’t...

21:17.830 --> 21:18.910
That’s right.

21:18.910 --> 21:21.170
Those kids are still inside that thing!

21:56.290 --> 22:01.970
My heart is racing and I'm going to give you

22:01.970 --> 22:07.170
This sparkling emotion

22:07.560 --> 22:13.300
The evening color is dyed into this orange shirt

22:13.360 --> 22:18.450
I catch it from behind you and my heart throbbing

22:18.560 --> 22:25.410
It's an everyday thrill just to be with you

22:25.410 --> 22:32.840
I can't say it well enough but thank you

22:32.840 --> 22:38.040
Venus Dream the hidden power

22:38.040 --> 22:44.240
This feeling will change into that power

22:44.240 --> 22:49.360
Power Dream I found what I want to protect

22:49.360 --> 22:55.770
That is your smile and your feelings

23:09.490 --> 23:12.900
It was short, but a lot happened.

23:12.900 --> 23:14.210
I wanted time to get

23:14.210 --> 23:16.300
a lot more intimately acquainted with Mamoru...

23:16.300 --> 23:19.040
Wait, what am I saying?

23:19.040 --> 23:20.990
But really...

23:20.990 --> 23:23.180
I’m thankful to God for being able

23:23.180 --> 23:26.760
to experience the joy of being a girl every day.

23:26.760 --> 23:31.110
I pray that I can stay with Mamoru forever.

23:31.110 --> 23:34.590
And that gentle, warm blessings be upon

23:34.590 --> 23:37.620
all who watched over us this far.

23:37.640 --> 23:39.060
Blessings of the Goddess upon Mamoru!
